  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"171\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"169\">Meet Denmark's leading modular &amp; practical comfort sofa brand.</strong></p><p data-start=\"173\" data-end=\"483\"><strong data-start=\"173\" data-end=\"188\">MODURI HOME</strong> is a Danish furniture brand founded with a vision to combine <em data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"312\">modern design, ultimate comfort, and practical functionality</em> in one solution. The result is a collection of modular, pet-friendly, and washable sofas designed for modern homes where style and everyday convenience go hand in hand.</p><p data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"727\">“Our mission is to make everyday life easier with furniture that not only looks beautiful but is also practical, durable, and adaptable to any space. That’s why we created a modular sofa collection that redefines comfort and functionality.”</p><p data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"762\"><strong data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"760\">MODURI HOME’s brand values:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"829\"><li data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"782\"><p data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"782\">Modular Comfort</p></li><li data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"804\"><p data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"804\">Functional Living</p></li><li data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"829\"><p data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"829\">Modern Danish Design</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"871\"><strong data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"869\">Key features of Moduri Home sofas:</strong></p><p data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"1417\">✔️&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"894\">Modular design</strong> – endless configurations to fit your space and needs<br data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"950\">✔️&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"986\">Pet- &amp; stain-resistant fabric</strong> – Smart Clean Fabrics™ resist spills and dirt<br data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1035\">✔️&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1070\">Washable &amp; changeable covers</strong> – easy maintenance and a fresh look anytime<br data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1117\">✔️&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1152\">Ergonomic CloudFoam® support</strong> – perfect balance of softness and support<br data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1197\">✔️&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1239\">Eco-friendly &amp; SGS-tested in the EU</strong> – sustainable materials built to last<br data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1280\">✔️&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1305\">Tool-free assembly</strong> – unbox, assemble, and enjoy in minutes<br data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1348\">✔️ <strong>3</strong><strong data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1370\">-year warranty</strong> – premium quality and peace of mind included</p><p data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1550\">With Moduri Home, you get <em data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1481\">design, comfort, and functionality</em> all in one — for homes that need to be both stylish and practical.</p><p data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1632\">View more on their website: <a data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1630\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_new\" class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https://modurihome.com/\">https://modurihome.com/</a></p></div></div>",
